// MsgOpenEscrow funds a conditional lock from the depositor's own account.
//
// Unlike every other lock, this does not come out of a treasury's balance —
// the money is the buyer's and moves straight into the module account, where
// neither party nor the platform can reach it. That is the point: the chain is
// the custodian, and no interface can make that untrue in either direction.
